sheet Jan
sheet Feb
set Jan!A1 100
set Feb!A1 =Jan!A1+50
set A1 =Jan!A1+Feb!A1
use Jan
rename Nope March
rename Jan 1st
rename Jan Feb
rename Jan Jan
rename Jan January
rename
sheets
show Sheet1!A1
show Feb!A1
set B1 =Jan!A1
set B1 =January!A1
show B1
get Sheet1!A1
rename Sheet1 Summary
sheets
use Summary
show A1
rename Feb Jan
show A1
show January!B1
